stateDiagram-v2
    %% Izara Doctor Portal - Queue State Machine
    
    [*] --> CheckedIn: Patient arrives/connects
    
    CheckedIn --> Waiting: Added to queue
    
    state Waiting {
        [*] --> InQueue
        InQueue --> PriorityEscalated: Emergency/Urgent
        PriorityEscalated --> InQueue: Priority adjusted
    }
    
    Waiting --> InConsultation: Doctor calls patient
    Waiting --> Skipped: Patient unavailable
    Waiting --> NoShow: No response (15 min)
    
    Skipped --> Waiting: Patient returns
    
    InConsultation --> Completed: Consultation ends normally
    InConsultation --> Paused: Need additional info/tests
    
    Paused --> InConsultation: Resume consultation
    Paused --> Completed: Resolve remotely
    
    Completed --> [*]
    NoShow --> [*]
    Skipped --> NoShow: Still unavailable (30 min)
    
    note right of CheckedIn
        Patient check-in recorded
        Queue number assigned
    end note
    
    note right of Waiting
        Estimated wait time calculated
        Real-time queue updates
    end note
    
    note right of InConsultation
        EMR editing active
        AI Copilot available
    end note
    
    note right of Completed
        EMR finalized
        Prescriptions sent
        Follow-up scheduled
    end note
